Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: clock: apple,nco: Add the T7001

The A8X NCO is the T8010 block with its channels 0x1000 apart instead
of 0x4000. Add apple,t7001-nco.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Signed-off-by: ricktav <82380971+ricktav@users.noreply.github.com>
---
 Documentation/devicetree/bindings/clock/apple,nco.yaml | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/clock/apple,nco.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/clock/apple,nco.yaml
index 9a1997e62..a23660034 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/clock/apple,nco.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/clock/apple,nco.yaml
@@ -20,6 +20,7 @@ description: |
 properties:
   compatible:
     oneOf:
+      - const: apple,t7001-nco
       - const: apple,t8010-nco
       - items:
           - const: apple,t6020-nco
-- 
